/target
**/*.rs.bk
/.direnv/

# `nix build` output symlinks (`-o result-foo` variants included). These point
# into /nix/store and are machine-local, so committing one dirties every
# checkout that builds and leaves a dangling link in fresh clones.
#
# NOTE: do NOT extend this to `/.cacophony/`. Managed-agent session artefacts
# under `.cacophony/agent/**` are discovered by diffing COMMITTED content on the
# agent branch, so ignoring them silently drops every summary with no error
# (bd-f08617 reverted exactly that in 8703865).
/result
/result-*
